  <Title>k__BackingField: Safety Module Complete
  <Description>k__BackingField: Congratulations on completing the Warehouse Safety
    module. You have demonstrated your understanding of PPE requirements, hazard
    identification, emergency procedures, and load safety. These are the four pillars
    that keep every person on this floor protected. The habits you build in safety
    training carry into every shift you work. Stay aware, speak up when you see a
    hazard, and look out for your colleagues. Operational training modules are now
    unlocked. Choose your next module to continue.
